	(footprint "irl2fa:BatteryHolder_MYOUNG_BS-24-B4AA016_CR2450"
		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "8a6057bb-753b-466c-98cc-0f84152422af")
		(at 140 117)
		(descr "MYOUNG BS-24-B4AA016 (BS-2450-2 Au) SMT CR2450 holder, open frame, gold contacts (LCSC C964809), drawing MY-CP-0138 rev A/0. Pads 3.62x4.50, outer span 37.00, inner span 29.75. Pad 1 = + (right), pad 2 = - (left); both contacts are end terminals, the holder has no PCB-side contact pad (the - spring presses the cell's bottom face from the holder floor). Body 27.2x16.0, 36.0 over the terminals, height 7.50 above the PCB. The 24.5 mm cell overhangs the body by 4.25 mm on each long side.")
